ok - pack waits with 75 and writes nothing when D: is not published
ok - pack commits a verified image with its sidecars and one receipt line
ok - verify --against refuses a source that changed after packing
ok - pack refuses with 1 and commits nothing when the source changes
ok - verify fails on a changed image byte or members list
ok - pack never overwrites a unit
ok - pack and verify refuse with 2 before any work on an unknown or unusable reader
ok - pack refuses with 2 when the D: root and SRC overlap
ok - restore unpacks and checks the unit, and waits for room
ok - verify reads the image through a fresh squashfuse mount
